  "_sourceRefs": [
    "PyX12 (azoner/pyx12) 837Q3.I.5010.X223.A1.xml — the institutional counterpart to loops/2300-claim.json (837P's own shared claim subtree). Genuinely different shape, not a copy: CL1 (Institutional Claim Code) replaces nothing (no professional equivalent), SV2 replaces SV1/SV5, no SV1/SV5/CR1/CR2/CR3/QTY/MEA/PS1/2440 (ambulance/spinal/DME/form-identification are professional-only concepts), 2320 gains BOTH MIA and MOA (institutional has separate inpatient/outpatient adjudication segments) and 9 Other-Payer sub-loops (2330A-I, not 837P's 7 A-G) — institutional distinguishes 'Operating Physician' from 'Other Operating Physician' as separate provider roles the professional IG doesn't have. Referenced from 837I's own 2000B/2000C positions via the SAME loopRef mechanism as 837P's 2300-claim.json — see that file's own _sourceRefs for the full duplication-avoidance rationale, and CLAUDE.md's EDI Phase 2 section."
